> [San] Diego Tropicals offers interior plant design and maintenance service for commercial and residential properties. We specialize in design and installation of live interior plants to help make your home or office beautiful. We will help to create the image you desire through exceptional service. Our employees are professional and knowledgeable and will ensure that your plants are healthy and vibrant.
